<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>AI &amp; Agent 开发者晨报</title><link>https://yingfengke.github.io/agent-news-briefing</link><description>每日 AI 领域精选新闻与深度分析</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 08:53:17 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://yingfengke.github.io/agent-news-briefing/web/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" /><item><title>Reward AI发布OM-1：仅使用人类演示训练的机器人策略</title><link>https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/09/14/reward-ai-releases-om-1-a-robot-policy-trained-on-human-demonstrations-only-with-no-teleoperation-or-on-robot-data/</link><description>机器人初创公司Reward AI推出OM-1机器人策略，声称仅使用人类演示数据进行训练，无需遥操作或机器人本体数据，即可学习复杂操作技能，团队此前参与过DexCap等项目。</description><guid>https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/09/14/reward-ai-releases-om-1-a-robot-policy-trained-on-human-demonstrations-only-with-no-teleoperation-or-on-robot-data/</guid><source>MarkTechPost</source><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 05:08:17 +0800</pubDate><category>产品与发布</category><category>机器人</category><category>具身智能</category></item><item><title>SAS：通过上下文排名的端到端优化实现简单注意力稀疏化</title><link>https://x.com/_akhaliq/status/2099511334987522298</link><description>推特账号@_akhaliq公布论文SAS（Simple Attention Sparsification），提出通过端到端优化上下文排序来实现注意力稀疏化，在保持模型性能的前提下显著降低计算开销，论文已发布。</description><guid>https://x.com/_akhaliq/status/2099511334987522298</guid><source>Twitter @_akhaliq</source><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 22:51:23 +0800</pubDate><category>论文与研究</category><category>注意力机制</category><category>稀疏化</category></item><item><title>物理信息保形预测：将PDE一致性嵌入无分布不确定性量化</title><link>https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.11935</link><description>新论文提出物理信息保形预测（Physics-Informed Conformal Prediction），将偏微分方程一致性约束嵌入无分布不确定性量化框架中，用于神经算子输出，提供严格统计保证。</description><guid>https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.11935</guid><source>ArXiv CL</source><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>论文与研究</category><category>不确定性量化</category><category>物理信息</category></item><item><title>使用Amazon Bedrock AgentCore管理AI代理的端用户OAuth同意</title><link>https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/manage-end-user-oauth-consent-for-ai-agents-with-amazon-bedrock-agentcore/</link><description>AWS发布新指南，介绍如何通过Amazon Bedrock AgentCore管理最终用户的OAuth授权，使AI代理能够安全地代表用户访问GitHub、Slack等第三方服务。</description><guid>https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/manage-end-user-oauth-consent-for-ai-agents-with-amazon-bedrock-agentcore/</guid><source>AWS ML Blog</source><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 04:35:45 +0800</pubDate><category>Agent框架</category><category>OAuth</category><category>授权管理</category></item><item><title>R2VC：基于检索、验证和置信度校准的模块化事实核查</title><link>https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.11955</link><description>新论文提出R2VC模块化事实核查框架，整合检索、验证与置信度校准三个环节，可提高大语言模型对事实性陈述的核查准确率，并给出不确定度估计。</description><guid>https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.11955</guid><source>ArXiv CL</source><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>论文与研究</category><category>事实核查</category><category>可靠性</category></item><item><title>Abnormal AI：使用Amazon Bedrock AgentCore实现大规模智能邮件安全</title><link>https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/abnormal-ai-amazon-bedrock-agentcore-for-agentic-email-security-at-scale/</link><description>AWS博客案例展示Abnormal AI利用Amazon Bedrock AgentCore构建代理式邮件安全系统，已能在每天数十亿操作的生产规模下运行，实现自动检测与响应。</description><guid>https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/abnormal-ai-amazon-bedrock-agentcore-for-agentic-email-security-at-scale/</guid><source>AWS ML Blog</source><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 05:22:45 +0800</pubDate><category>产品与发布</category><category>Agent应用</category><category>邮件安全</category></item><item><title>大型科技公司的AI放缓：安全协议还是卡特尔？</title><link>https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/995186/is-big-techs-ai-slowdown-a-safety-pact-or-a-cartel</link><description>Anthropic CEO Dario Amodei呼吁减缓AI发展，引发业界分裂。黄仁勋在特朗普面前明确表示"不会让AI放缓发生"，另有政界与技术高管发表不同意见。（该消息被多家来源报道：The Verge、TechCrunch、MIT Tech Review、Simon Willison）</description><guid>https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/995186/is-big-techs-ai-slowdown-a-safety-pact-or-a-cartel</guid><source>The Verge AI</source><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 06:59:41 +0800</pubDate><category>行业动态</category><category>AI安全</category><category>政策</category></item><item><title>视频记忆是否使用了其检索的内容？记忆特异性的因果审计</title><link>https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.12090</link><description>论文对视频模型的记忆机制进行因果审计，探究模型在生成时是否真正使用了其检索的记忆内容，发现记忆使用存在特异性偏差，检索内容可能未被有效利用。</description><guid>https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.12090</guid><source>ArXiv CL</source><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>论文与研究</category><category>视频生成</category><category>记忆机制</category></item><item><title>Fyxer如何构建值得信赖的AI行政助理</title><link>https://openai.com/index/fyxer</link><description>OpenAI官方案例介绍Fyxer公司，它使用OpenAI模型、微调、记忆和真实用户反馈来组织邮件、日历和联系人，构建企业级AI行政助理，重点解决信任问题。</description><guid>https://openai.com/index/fyxer</guid><source>OpenAI</source><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 20:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>产品与发布</category><category>企业应用</category><category>AI助理</category></item><item><title>RSI不会发生</title><link>https://www.reddit.com/r/MachineLearning/comments/1wgazy4/rsi_is_not_happening_r/</link><description>Reddit机器学习板块分享新论文，论证递归自我改进（RSI）不会发生，基于对当前AI系统学习机制和收敛特性的分析，引发社区讨论。</description><guid>https://www.reddit.com/r/MachineLearning/comments/1wgazy4/rsi_is_not_happening_r/</guid><source>Reddit ML</source><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 02:03:41 +0800</pubDate><category>论文与研究</category><category>AI安全</category><category>自我改进</category></item><item><title>OpenAI有数百名合同工阅读你的ChatGPT对话</title><link>https://the-decoder.com/openai-has-hundreds-of-contract-workers-reading-your-chatgpt-conversations/</link><description>据报道，OpenAI雇佣数百名合同工阅读真实ChatGPT对话并参与标注和质量控制，引发用户隐私担忧。OpenAI称此做法用于模型改进，并已采取脱敏措施。</description><guid>https://the-decoder.com/openai-has-hundreds-of-contract-workers-reading-your-chatgpt-conversations/</guid><source>The Decoder</source><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 01:15:28 +0800</pubDate><category>行业动态</category><category>隐私</category><category>数据治理</category></item><item><title>微软AI规则手册：可读思维、无内在生命、无权利</title><link>https://the-decoder.com/microsofts-ai-rulebook-readable-thinking-no-inner-life-and-definitely-no-rights/</link><description>微软AI发布其MAI模型的运营行为准则，强调模型思维应可读、不具备内在生命，且不赋予任何权利，以确立对AI的清晰人文控制边界。</description><guid>https://the-decoder.com/microsofts-ai-rulebook-readable-thinking-no-inner-life-and-definitely-no-rights/</guid><source>The Decoder</source><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 23:52:51 +0800</pubDate><category>行业动态</category><category>AI治理</category><category>伦理</category></item><item><title>首届蚂蚁灵波具身大模型挑战赛正式启动</title><link>https://www.qbitai.com/2026/09/489105.html</link><description>蚂蚁集团旗下的灵波宣布启动首届具身大模型挑战赛，旨在推广其LingBot-VLA模型，吸引开发者与高校科研社区参与，赛事覆盖导航、操作等多个任务。</description><guid>https://www.qbitai.com/2026/09/489105.html</guid><source>量子位</source><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 17:47:07 +0800</pubDate><category>行业动态</category><category>具身智能</category><category>竞赛</category></item><item><title>OpenAI以3亿美元收购智能手机相机公司Glass Imaging</title><link>https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/14/openai-buys-smartphone-camera-maker-glass-imaging-for-300-million-report-says/</link><description>据悉OpenAI以约3亿美元收购由前苹果工程师创立的相机公司Glass Imaging，该公司专注于计算摄影和图像质量增强，预计将增强OpenAI的视觉与多模态能力。</description><guid>https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/14/openai-buys-smartphone-camera-maker-glass-imaging-for-300-million-report-says/</guid><source>TechCrunch AI</source><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 04:44:14 +0800</pubDate><category>行业动态</category><category>收购</category><category>多模态</category></item><item><title>Slashy Assistant：帮你处理邮件的AI助手</title><link>https://www.producthunt.com/products/slashy-3</link><description>Product Hunt上线Slashy Assistant，这是一款专为处理电子邮件设计的AI助手，能自动撰写回复、分类和归档邮件，当前已在Product Hunt发布。</description><guid>https://www.producthunt.com/products/slashy-3</guid><source>Product Hunt</source><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 10:52:46 +0800</pubDate><category>产品与发布</category><category>邮件助手</category></item><item><title>商汤大装置临港AIDC获‘算效+算电’双5A认证</title><link>https://www.qbitai.com/2026/09/489106.html</link><description>商汤科技位于临港的人工智能计算中心（AIDC）获得业界首个"算效+算电"双5A认证，代表其在计算效率和算电协同方面达到最高评估等级。</description><guid>https://www.qbitai.com/2026/09/489106.html</guid><source>量子位</source><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 17:46:40 +0800</pubDate><category>行业动态</category><category>算力基础设施</category><category>能效</category></item><item><title>DevFest 2026回归</title><link>https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/devfest2026/</link><description>Google宣布DevFest 2026回归，全球超过80个社区将举办活动，涵盖AI、开发者工具等主题，并分享最新技术更新与本地社区连接机会。</description><guid>https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/devfest2026/</guid><source>Google AI</source><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>开发者社区</category></item><item><title>今日深度分析 - 2026-09-15</title><link>https://yingfengke.github.io/agent-news-briefing</link><description>今日多个信号表明，AI Agent工程化正在走向成熟：Bedrock AgentCore的OAuth管理与大规模部署案例展示了企业级代理的技术栈，而具身智能（OM-1、蚂蚁挑战赛）则从数据采集端突破。同时，注意力稀疏化（SAS）与物理信息保形预测等论文预示着推理效率与不确定性量化将成为未来6个月模型优化的核心。随着安全争论升温，可预期业界将出现更多治理框架，但技术加速难以被真正刹车。</description><guid>https://yingfengke.github.io/agent-news-briefing/daily-analysis/20260915</guid></item></channel></rss>